        },
        {
            "Id": 141831006,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 6,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'说到伊吕波就是 Cosplay。/n　说到 Cosplay 就是伊吕波……也已经有这种印象了。'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310060",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831007,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 7,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'春季上镜大赛的时候，不也拿到了“果然还是 Cosplay 奖”吗？/n　所以，我觉得挺好的。'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310070",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831008,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 8,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "是。明明应该没什么可犹豫的……可一想到这是比赛。/n我又想拿一个能贪心地瞄准第一名的点子来决胜负……！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310080",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
                    "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831009,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 9,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'要说春天人气高的……/n就是卡米拉和蕾的卡拉 OK 吧。'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310090",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831010,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 10,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "正因为是经典中的经典，大家才一起忽略了，真是失策！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310100",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831011,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'美兔我们后来也想唱歌，就一起去卡拉 OK 了呢。/n临时卡拉 OK 大会。真的很开心……'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310110",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831012,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 12,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "能知道大家那些不为人知的、对春天的感受也很有趣，/n会成为人气第一我完全能理解。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310120",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831013,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 13,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "啊，也就是说，穿着 Cosplay 去唱卡拉 OK 的话……？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310130",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 16,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831014,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'唔——，只是春天没这么做而已，说普通的话也挺普通……不是吗？'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310140",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831015,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "也是啊。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310150",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'啊……要是做一个以夏天为舞台的经典动画歌曲特辑……怎么样？/n比如《アブラゼミ爆弾の弾ける頃に》……'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310160",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "确实也有《アレテメーノジョイ》和《Earth》这种名作。/n说不定可以。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310170",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831018,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 18,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'对对。像演唱会……或者概念性很强的专辑、/n播放列表那样，编一套故事性很强的 Setlist。'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310180",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831019,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 19,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "只要用上下文去撩动宅宅的心，就能争取高分。/n春天的时候还没有人做到这种程度！",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310190",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 8,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831020,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 20,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'中间也可以夹一首像《サマバカ》那样……很能炒热气氛的歌吧。'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310200",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831021,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 21,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "然后再用一首让人想起晚夏的舒缓歌曲来催泪……。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310210",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831022,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 22,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……听起来是不错。/n唔唔～，但这不就是炒冷饭嘛。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310220",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831023,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 23,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'与其说新点子，更像是在原本的东西上重新编排。/n　不太有创新……对吧。'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310230",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831024,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 24,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "虽然也不只是单纯重复利用，/n但冲击力果然还是会弱一些。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310240",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831025,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 25,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'是啊。卡拉 OK 应该还是会很有人气。/n　不过难得要做，还是想搞个让大家都大吃一惊的企划……'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310250",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "402"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831026,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 26,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "就是因为这种点子不会轻飘飘地自己冒出来，才让人头疼呀。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310260",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 112,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831027,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 27,
            "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……看来美兔也想不到。/n虽然老套，但王道就是王道，要不要还是定 Cosplay 呢？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310270",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 72,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "401"
        },
        {
            "Id": 141831028,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 141831,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 28,
            "SpeakerName": "美兔",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "'……对了。/n　要不要也问问其他人的意见……？'",
            "VoiceFileName": "1418310280",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
